title Cassette notice for the first lost audio of a take (T6e), and lost 0.3 s on the strip once it ends; through the server too
sizes 480x320 320x480 640x480
ppmm 608
env CASSETTE_DEMO recording
env CASSETTE_DEMO_SERVER 1
env CASSETTE_DEMO_LOST_MS 300
env CASSETTE_DEMO_NOTICE "Some audio was lost: the card or the disk could not keep up"
env CASSETTE_LAYOUT_CHECK 1

wait 600
expect text "Some audio was lost: the card or the disk could not keep up"
shot lost-notice
expect notext "LAYOUT FAIL"
@320x480 tap "Some audio was lost: the card or the disk could not keep up"
@320x480 wait 300
@320x480 expect text "#8E1D15 lost 0.3 s#"
@320x480 shot lost-after-notice
@480x320,640x480 say the strip under the notice carries the server mark and lost 0.3 s
expect noquit
